title: 基础②·喜欢的吃喝
scriptType: practice
---
Tutor: I like coffee. How about you?
#objective: Tell what you like to drink
#chunks: I like coffee.,I prefer noodles.,I don't drink coffee.
#user_input
Tutor: Do you like milk?
#objective: Say yes and tell your habit
#chunks: I like coffee.,I don't drink coffee.
#user_input
Tutor: Do you drink milk every morning?
#objective: Tell what you usually drink
#chunks: I don't drink coffee.,I prefer noodles.
#user_input
Tutor: What food do you like?
#objective: Tell your food preference
#chunks: I prefer noodles.,I like coffee.
#user_input
Tutor: I like noodles too.
#objective: Agree — you like the same food
#chunks: I like coffee.,I prefer noodles.
#user_input
Tutor: Great. We like the same food.
#objective: Complete the exchange naturally
#chunks: I like coffee.,I prefer noodles.,I don't drink coffee.
#user_input
Tutor: Well done! You can now talk about food and drinks you like.
-> END
